  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VCA WWF Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will focus on women, young people and indigenous population living in thetransboundary Pantanal - Chaco ecoregions (PACHA - Paraguay and Bolivia). Its objective is to &#x201c;amplifytheir voices&#x201d;, to ensure that they are participating, heard and taken into account in designing solutionsfor climate transition and common agendas to reach climate justice.</narrative>
  </description>
