  <result aggregation-status="1" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCS1 # of laws and policies for sustainable and inclusive development that are better implemented as a result of CSO engagement</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This result shows the number of laws and policies that are better implemented as a result of VCA efforts</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN"># of laws for sustainable and inclusive development that are better implemented as a result of CSO engagement;</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Measures the number of laws that are better implemented as a result of VCA efforts</narrative>
    </description>
    <reference code="SCS011" indicator-uri="https://helpdesk-opendata-minbuza.nl/indicator-codelist/" vocabulary="99"></reference>
    <baseline value="0" year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">PY- Law 5875/19 Climate Change National Law: The law includes the creation of a climate fund, which is yet to be structured.PY- BO - Laws that ensure inclusion and universal human rights: Norms and laws on inclusion should be drafted to protect the human rights of target groups.PY - BO - Laws recognizing indigenous peoples&#x2019; rights: Laws to protect the rights of Indigenous People exist, but are not implemented, do not secure protection of human rights, participation, and inclusion in decision-making processesBO - Mother Earth Rights Law (Law 071) and Framework Law of Mother Earth and Integral Development to Live Well (Law 300): Little knowledge of the scope of the law by civil society and non-compliance by the authorities.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-01-07"></period-end>
     <actual value="0"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <actual value="5"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="2">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">PY- Law 5875/19 Climate Change National Law: Amendment: It is necessary that the fund structure effectively contemplates access to resources by local governments, and responds to the real needs of the most vulnerable stakeholders. The fund created by law incorporates a strategy for the participation of local communities and indigenous peoples.PY- BO - Laws that ensure inclusion and universal human rights: Drafting and adoption: Formulation of a law that ensures secure protection and inclusion of target groups, such as journalists, landless communities, women, youth.PY - BO - Laws recognizing indigenous peoples&#x2019; rights: Inclusion and implementation: Secure protection of human rights, participation, and inclusion in decision-making processes.BO - Mother Earth Rights Law (Law 071) and Framework Law of Mother Earth and Integral Development to Live Well (Law 300): Implementation: That the law is widely known and rights are exercised.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
